  WHY THIS MODULE. Wave C is gui alone — 351 source files, the single
  largest module migrated so far and the largest until xcos (Wave E). It is
  also the ONE module the continuation-line fix in build-parity/parity/
  fingerprint.py's normalize_manifest was written to answer: gui is the only
  module remaining in this reactor that declares manifest.class-path
  (build.xml:9), and its six-entry value is long enough to WRAP across two
  manifest lines — see "THE CLASS-PATH WRAP" below for the measured proof
  and the actual bytes on both sides.

  STEP 1 FINDINGS (./maven-module-deps.sh gui, 351 files):
    [1] imports (excluding gui's own packages) resolve to TEN reactor
        dependencies — every one already migrated by an earlier wave, which
        is exactly what let Wave C consist of gui alone:
          action_binding (InterpreterManagement, highlevel.
          ScilabInterpreterManagement), commons ({,gui,utils,xml}.*),
          console (HelpBrowser, OneCharKeyEventListener, SciConsole,
          SciHistoryManager, SciInputCommandView, SciOutputView, utils.
          ScilabSpecialTextUtilities), graphic_export (Driver, ExportParams,
