          family — arc/axes/console/datatip/figure/graphicController/
          graphicModel/graphicObject/graphicView/uicontrol/utils and the full
          GraphicObjectProperties.__GO_*__ static-import family),
          history_manager (HistoryManagement), jvm (LoadClassPath),
