          renderer (CallRenderer, JoGLView{,.axes,.util}, utils.*), and
          scirenderer (Canvas, implementation.{jogl,vulkan}.*,
          tranformations.Vector3d — see the JOGL/GlueGen entry below for why
          the vulkan sub-package sits in scirenderer, not a separate jar).
        All ten already carry Maven coordinates from Waves A/B/earlier
