  COORDINATES AS modules/renderer/pom.xml and modules/scirenderer/pom.xml
  (cross-referenced, not restated — see renderer's "THE GLBUFFERS FINDING"
  for the full inherited-member mechanism and scirenderer's <dependencies>
  comment for the systemPath-vs-alternatives rationale shared with
  modules/commons/pom.xml's flexdock entry). gui's own JOGL surface is wider
  than renderer's (javap -p on jogl-all-2.5.0.jar shows GLCanvas/GLJPanel
  implementing com.jogamp.nativewindow.* interfaces alongside the JOGL ones,
  all bundled inside jogl-all.jar itself), and the full-reactor build below
  is what actually settles whether gluegen-rt's classes are ever reached —
  reproduced here as a pair because every other JOGL-using module in this
  reactor needs both and Ant's own shared compile.classpath never offers one
  without the other.

  THE THREE-JAR CLASS-PATH TAIL, VERIFIED PER-CLASS. gson (com.google.gson.
  Gson — SwingScilabBrowser.java, the CEF-backed help/plot browser bridge)
  and jcef-api (org.cef.* — CefApp/CefClient/CefBrowser/CefFrame/
